  "title": "Present tense: conjugation patterns",
  "description": "The main endings of the present tense, and the most common irregular verbs.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Polish verbs change their ending for each person, so the pronoun (ja, ty…) is usually left out: Czytam means I read. Most verbs follow one of a few patterns; the I form and the you form tell you which.",
      "table": {
        "caption": "Regular patterns",
        "columns": [
          "Person",
          "czytać (to read)",
          "mówić (to speak)",
          "pisać (to write)",
          "pracować (to work)"
        ],
        "rows": [
          ["ja", "czytam", "mówię", "piszę", "pracuję"],
          ["ty", "czytasz", "mówisz", "piszesz", "pracujesz"],
          ["on / ona / ono", "czyta", "mówi", "pisze", "pracuje"],
          ["my", "czytamy", "mówimy", "piszemy", "pracujemy"],
          ["wy", "czytacie", "mówicie", "piszecie", "pracujecie"],
          ["oni / one", "czytają", "mówią", "piszą", "pracują"]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "heading": "Common irregular verbs",
      "table": {
        "columns": [
          "Person",
          "być (to be)",
          "mieć (to have)",
          "iść (to go)",
          "jeść (to eat)",
          "chcieć (to want)",
          "móc (can)"
        ],
        "rows": [
          ["ja", "jestem", "mam", "idę", "jem", "chcę", "mogę"],
          ["ty", "jesteś", "masz", "idziesz", "jesz", "chcesz", "możesz"],
          ["on / ona / ono", "jest", "ma", "idzie", "je", "chce", "może"],
          ["my", "jesteśmy", "mamy", "idziemy", "jemy", "chcemy", "możemy"],
          ["wy", "jesteście", "macie", "idziecie", "jecie", "chcecie", "możecie"],
          ["oni / one", "są", "mają", "idą", "jedzą", "chcą", "mogą"]
        ]
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "text": "Mam dwa koty.",
          "translation": "I have two cats."
        },
        {
          "text": "Co robisz?",
          "translation": "What are you doing?"
        },
        {
          "text": "Oni mieszkają w Gdańsku.",
          "translation": "They live in Gdańsk."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
